      "moved_to_wing": "Ransomware Mass-Encryption Burst (Behaviour)",
      "why": "A burst spans many files, and each file is its own identity, so a per-identity threshold only saw one file's journal rows. The Behavioural engine counts UBA's file_edited / file_renamed bursts per person."
